        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Chiltern Shakespeare Company\n- Works: Twelfth Night, She's the Man, Just One of the Guys\n- People: William Shakespeare\n- Topics: Shakespeare adaptations, recent productions\n\nFacts:\n- William Shakespeare wrote the comedy \"Twelfth Night, or What You Will\" around 1601–02 as Twelfth Night entertainment for the close of the Christmas season.\n- The 2006 film \"She's the Man\" was inspired by William Shakespeare's play \"Twelfth Night\" and is a remake of the 1985 film \"Just One of the Guys\".\n- Chiltern Shakespeare Company recently produced \"Much Ado about Nothing,\" \"Twelfth Night,\" \"A Midsummer Night's Dream,\" \"As You Like It,\" \"The Taming of the Shrew,\" \"The Merchant of Venice,\" and \"The Merry Wives of Windsor\".",
